  ],
  "description": "To resolve the composition of the tumor milieu and recreate the cellular map of glioblastoma, isocitrate dehydrogenase (IDH)-wildtype (GB), we created the \u2018GBmap\u2019, a curated resource that at its core harmonizes 16 datasets gathering 110 patients and spanning over 330 thousand cells. By transfer learning, we \u2018upgraded\u2019 our atlas reference (extended GBmap) with another ten datasets, including our own profiled GB tissues resulting in a collection of 26 studies, 240 patients, and more than 1.1 million cells.",
